	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Accepi 15. huius litteras tuas, clarissime vir idemque amice incomparabilis, quibus initio <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>meae petitioni fideliter respondes, super qua et tibi gratias ago et super pii principis studio in veram <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>religionem valde letatus sum.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Dominus deus dirigat porro gressus illius secundum verbum suum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>De <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinando</persName>, monachorum et pontificiorum mancipio iam antea nichil michi aliud pollicebar; <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>dominus reducat illum in viam rectam aut sua potentia illum cohibeat, ne noceat tam <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>sancto cursui evangelii.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quod Carolo 5. exequias celebrandas parat, vereor ne nimis sero; <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>alias non male consultum video hisce nugis quam pontificiae culinę iuxta proverbium Ger<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>manicum: <foreign xml:lang="de">Wenn die pfaffen das requiem im kor hand, so sind gwärtig des <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>gaudeamus in der kuchen.</foreign></s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="de">Alßo ist das Machabeorum der pfaffen heylthumb; dann <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ist ein schwartzer pur in eynem wyßen lilachen ve[r]näyt, den pfaffen ein so kostlich <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>wildprät.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="de">Was ist dann ihnen zuͦ gewarten von dem keyßerlichen unuberwintlichosten <lb xml:id="p1z12"/><foreign xml:lang="la">(si diis placet, experientia aliter sequitur)</foreign> cörper, in samet und syden verhasplet?</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z13"/>Huiusmodi ludibria tanquam frivolas nenias parit deus ille Marsim in quo vere <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>habitat plenitudo Sathanę corporati; dominus in dies liberet tot morbis adflictam ecclesiam a tantis <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>erroribus.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Quod parat bellum contra <placeName ref="l2510">Turcam</placeName>, pristinę querelae sunt, quibus exhauriuntur <placeName ref="l822">Germa<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>norum</placeName> marsupiae, debilitantur vires.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Mercatores semper conqueruntur de submersa navi, ut <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>interim suas merces maioris vendant et liberius luxurientur.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Ad eundem morbum <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinandus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>semper occinit contilenam de subiugando <placeName ref="l2510">Turca</placeName>, ut corrasis unidque nummis Sardanapalicos <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>mores fovere possit ac pontificiis gratificari.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Mortem regis <persName ref="p3671">Danię</persName> resartiat dominus <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>sua ęterna sapientia optimo atque pio principe.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Quod de profectu evangelii in regno <lb xml:id="p1z21"/><placeName ref="l2472">Polonię</placeName> et <placeName ref="l830">Anglie</placeName> scribis, summo gaudio perfusus sum; meis orationibus tam sancto negotio non deero.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Libellum, quem sub praelo excudendum dicis, responsionum ad 61 ad questiones papistarum, magno <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>desiderio et michi, <persName ref="p8440">Gervasio</persName> tuo, communicari peto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Insuper, si quid habes residuum memorialium <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>in Iheremiam, obsecro, praesente nunctio, <placeName ref="l285">Lentzburgensi</placeName> civi, ad me mitte.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Interim dominus deus te corpore diu simul et anima ecclesię suę conservet incolumem.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Saluta uxorem tuam et michi in domino charam una cum tota familia.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>plurimum <persName ref="p20679">Delspergerus</persName> meus simul et <persName ref="p8369">Hammanus</persName> noster multis modis adflictus.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>16. februarii anno 1559.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8440">Schuͦler</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Veteri suo amico domino <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>colendissimo d. <persName ref="p495">Heynricho <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesię <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>antistiti fidelissimo, ad manus.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zür[ich]</placeName><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de">An meyster <persName ref="p495">Heynrich Bullinger</persName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>